<h1>Reset your password</h1>

<p>Hi <%= @user.name.presence || @user.handle %>,</p>

<p>
  We received a request to reset your password. Click the link below to choose
  a new password. This link expires in one hour.
</p>

<p>
  <%= link_to "Reset your password", password_reset_url(@token) %>
</p>

<p>If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
